    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816740/extras/00fbe83488a9ba7ec8a17b99e860cf29.avif?t=1754959015\" width=600 height=281 /></span><i>&quot;They dreamt about you last night in their worst nightmares. It's your time to shine, Terry. You are their Augury of Death.&quot;</i><br>Augurium Mortis is a fast-paced top-down arena shooter where you control Amy Sol, a fighter hovercraft ace pilot singled out and cornered by her sworn enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She has nothing to loose and will fight to the death in a deep jungle located in a dystopian world in a planet far away into the future.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0   \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816740/extras/bb71b3d799e32e606e2f8aa02084d916.poster.avif?t=1754959015\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816740/extras/bb71b3d799e32e606e2f8aa02084d916.webm?t=1754959015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816740/extras/bb71b3d799e32e606e2f8aa02084d916.mp4?t=1754959015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fend off waves of mechs and large robots trying with your weapon arsenal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load up your charge by killing enemies, special moves grant you more energy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your ultra to deal devastating blows to the enemy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music</strong><br>John Black  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different types of enemies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0    \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816740/extras/27937679b93b7e4af8efbdc93531ffc4.poster.avif?t=1754959015\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816740/extras/27937679b93b7e4af8efbdc93531ffc4.webm?t=1754959015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816740/extras/27937679b93b7e4af8efbdc93531ffc4.mp4?t=1754959015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a diverse range of enemies, each bringing unique challenges that push you to adapt on the fly, think strategically, and make split-second choices if you want to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockables</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete tasks to fully unleash the power of your arsenal by unlocking new weapons and parts and optimize your destruction power to infinity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0    \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816740/extras/e679b159ef7d9916d1b751bf0d5fe887.poster.avif?t=1754959015\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816740/extras/e679b159ef7d9916d1b751bf0d5fe887.webm?t=1754959015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816740/extras/e679b159ef7d9916d1b751bf0d5fe887.mp4?t=1754959015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816740/extras/00fbe83488a9ba7ec8a17b99e860cf29.avif?t=1754959015\" width=600 height=281 /></span><i>&quot;They dreamt about you last night in their worst nightmares. It's your time to shine, Terry. You are their Augury of Death.&quot;</i><br>Augurium Mortis is a fast-paced top-down arena shooter where you control Amy Sol, a fighter hovercraft ace pilot singled out and cornered by her sworn enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She has nothing to loose and will fight to the death in a deep jungle located in a dystopian world in a planet far away into the future.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0   \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816740/extras/bb71b3d799e32e606e2f8aa02084d916.poster.avif?t=1754959015\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816740/extras/bb71b3d799e32e606e2f8aa02084d916.webm?t=1754959015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816740/extras/bb71b3d799e32e606e2f8aa02084d916.mp4?t=1754959015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fend off waves of mechs and large robots trying with your weapon arsenal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load up your charge by killing enemies, special moves grant you more energy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your ultra to deal devastating blows to the enemy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music</strong><br>John Black  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different types of enemies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0    \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816740/extras/27937679b93b7e4af8efbdc93531ffc4.poster.avif?t=1754959015\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816740/extras/27937679b93b7e4af8efbdc93531ffc4.webm?t=1754959015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816740/extras/27937679b93b7e4af8efbdc93531ffc4.mp4?t=1754959015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a diverse range of enemies, each bringing unique challenges that push you to adapt on the fly, think strategically, and make split-second choices if you want to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockables</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete tasks to fully unleash the power of your arsenal by unlocking new weapons and parts and optimize your destruction power to infinity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0    \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816740/extras/e679b159ef7d9916d1b751bf0d5fe887.poster.avif?t=1754959015\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816740/extras/e679b159ef7d9916d1b751bf0d5fe887.webm?t=1754959015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816740/extras/e679b159ef7d9916d1b751bf0d5fe887.mp4?t=1754959015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
